json5p/object
description: Comma-separated list of key-value pairs, enclosed into curly braces; a trailing comma is allowed
- >
  A json5p object is a
  [json5/object](::language:concretes:06-json5_code:00-json5_structured:00-json5_object)
  whose pairs are json5p pairs — a pair may anchor its value, and the value may be a pointer:
- !!<format: text/x-json5p> |
  {name: 'Rex', boss: &": chief" {}, buddy: *": pets: 1"}
- >
  The pair is a construct of its own — see the subchapter below:
- *: 00-json5p_key_value_pair
